{"seq":1,"slug":"number-systems-and-calculating-tools","title":"数字表示与早期计算工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/number-systems-and-calculating-tools","wordCount":3009,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字表示与早期计算工具\">数字表示与早期计算工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在任何机器能够&quot;计算&quot;之前，必须存在一种把数量写成可操作符号的约定。数字表示（number representation）解决的是同一个问题：如何用有限的一串符号，编码出任意大的数量，并让加法、乘法这类操作可以用机械步骤复现。现代计算机沿用的一套约定——按权展开的<strong>位值制</strong>（positional notation）、有限位宽下的<strong>模运算</strong>（modular arithmetic）、以及固定精度的<strong>浮点编码</strong>——并非某一次灵感，而是两千年间记账、天文与机械钟表反复打磨出来的工程结论。</p>\n<p>理解这段历史有一个直接好处：它解释了今天开发者遇到的怪现象为什么存在。<code>0.1 + 0.2 == 0.30000000000000004</code> 不是 bug，而是二进制浮点在 <code>IEEE 754</code>（美国电气电子工程师学会 1985 年发布、2008 年与 2019 年两次修订的标准，见 <a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/754/6210/\">IEEE 754-2019</a>）下的必然舍入结果；<code>int32</code> 溢出回绕与帕斯卡加法机的进位环是同一个数学结构。把数字表示作为&quot;计算理论的起点&quot;来看，这些都不是特例，而是同一个约束的当期形态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[结绳与刻痕: 一对一指代] --&gt; B[位值制: 巴比伦/印度/中国筹算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[机械加法: Pascal 1642 / Leibniz 1673]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Napier 对数与算筹 1617]&#10;    C --&gt; E[二进制与布尔代数: Leibniz 1703 / Boole 1854]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[机器数字表示: 补码/定点/浮点]&#10;    F --&gt; G[IEEE 754 1985 统一浮点]&#10;    F --&gt; H[溢出与舍入: 当代工程约束]\">graph TD\n    A[结绳与刻痕: 一对一指代] --&gt; B[位值制: 巴比伦/印度/中国筹算]\n    B --&gt; C[机械加法: Pascal 1642 / Leibniz 1673]\n    B --&gt; D[Napier 对数与算筹 1617]\n    C --&gt; E[二进制与布尔代数: Leibniz 1703 / Boole 1854]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[机器数字表示: 补码/定点/浮点]\n    F --&gt; G[IEEE 754 1985 统一浮点]\n    F --&gt; H[溢出与舍入: 当代工程约束]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方案</th>\n<th>出现时间</th>\n<th>基数</th>\n<th>关键特征</th>\n<th>当代对应物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结绳/刻痕</td>\n<td>史前</td>\n<td>一</td>\n<td>一对一，无位值</td>\n<td>计数器的物理初值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>六十进制</td>\n<td>约公元前 2000 年</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>巴比伦天文用，遗留下 60 秒/分</td>\n<td>时间与角度表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>十进位值制</td>\n<td>约公元 5-7 世纪</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>零参与运算，中国人以筹算实现</td>\n<td>十进制数、BCD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制</td>\n<td>1703 年系统化</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>只用 0/1，匹配开关器件</td>\n<td>全部现代硬件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定点/浮点</td>\n<td>20 世纪</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>固定位宽 + 指数</td>\n<td><code>int</code> / <code>float</code> 类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从结绳到算盘-位值制的技术前提\">从结绳到算盘：位值制的技术前提</h2><p>最早的&quot;计算工具&quot;是身体本身——手指、脚趾，以及结绳（quipu）与刻痕骨。这类方案的问题在于，符号与数量是<strong>一对一</strong>（unary）的：要表示 100 头羊就得刻 100 道痕。工具能表达的上限被物理长度锁死。</p>\n<p>真正的跃迁是<strong>位值制</strong>：同一个符号 <code>3</code>，在 30、300、3000 中代表不同的量，差别只由它所在的<strong>位置</strong>决定。用一个基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 表示整数，数值等于各位数字与基数的幂之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\sum_{i=0}^{n} d_i \\cdot b^i, \\quad 0 \\le d_i &lt; b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0691em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套写法把表达上限从&quot;符号数量&quot;变成&quot;位置数量&quot;，指数级地扩展了可表示范围。加法则退化为逐位的、可机械执行的步骤：从最低位开始相加，超过基数就向高位进位。<strong>进位（carry）是位值制赠予机械的第一个可自动化操作</strong>，此后所有机械计算器都是&quot;进位机构&quot;的变体。</p>\n<p>历史上位值制被独立发明过多次。巴比伦数学采用六十进制（sexagesimal），这一遗产今天还活在 60 秒一分钟、360 度一圈里。印度-阿拉伯数字在约公元 5 至 7 世纪引入了<strong>零</strong>作为一个可参与运算的数字，而不只是&quot;占位符&quot;——这是位值制能规模化笔算的关键。中国的<strong>筹算</strong>（counting rods）用一组小棒布列实现同样的十进位值制，配合《九章算术》（约成书于公元 1 世纪）的分数与开方算法，形成了一套不依赖纸面符号的计算流程。</p>\n<p>从筹算到<strong>算盘</strong>（abacus）的过渡意义重大：算盘把&quot;位&quot;固定在档上，把&quot;进位&quot;变成拨珠动作，第一次让位值制的每一位成为机器的一个可寻址单元（register）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机械计算器时代-从-napier-到-leibniz\">机械计算器时代：从 Napier 到 Leibniz</h2><p>17 世纪是机械计算的真正起点，三条独立路线几乎同时出现。</p>\n<p><strong>Napier 的对数与算筹。</strong> 苏格兰数学家 John Napier 于 1614 年发表对数，1617 年在《Rabdologiae》中提出后来被称为&quot;纳皮尔算筹&quot;（Napier&#39;s bones）的乘法辅助工具：把乘法拆成查表加加法，用刻在象牙条上的倍数表避免心算。对数把乘除转化为加减，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\times b = \\exp(\\ln a + \\ln b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这一&quot;降维&quot;思想后来直接进入浮点运算的算法设计。</p>\n<p><strong>Pascal 的加法机。</strong> 1642 年，为帮助担任税务官的父亲，19 岁的 Blaise Pascal 造出一台十进制加法机（Pascaline，见 <a href=\"https://www.computerhistory.org/\">Computer History Museum</a> 收藏与说明）。它用齿轮与一个精巧的&quot;sautoir&quot;机构处理进位——低位数齿轮转过 9 时，由一个重力驱动的棘爪把高位齿轮推进一位。这解决了机械进位的核心难题：<strong>如何只进一位，而不让进位的冲击反过来带动多余齿轮</strong>。Pascaline 主要通过补码式技巧实现减法，但它是第一台可靠到可以批量复制的计算器。</p>\n<p><strong>Leibniz 的步进计算器。</strong> 1673 年，Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz 在伦敦展示了改进的&quot;步进计算器&quot;（stepped reckoner），引入后来以他命名的 <strong>Leibniz wheel</strong>（阶梯滚轮）：一排长度不等、齿数递增的同轴齿轮，通过横向位移选择乘数位，一次转动即可完成乘以单个数字。它把乘法也纳入机械流程，是后世 Thomas 四则计算器（1820 年）与各类机械计算器的直接祖先。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机械</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>发明者</th>\n<th>支持运算</th>\n<th>进位机制</th>\n<th>历史意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纳皮尔算筹</td>\n<td>1617</td>\n<td>John Napier</td>\n<td>乘（化加）</td>\n<td>无（查表）</td>\n<td>用外部表降低运算复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帕斯卡加法机</td>\n<td>1642</td>\n<td>Blaise Pascal</td>\n<td>加/减</td>\n<td>sautoir 棘爪</td>\n<td>第一台可靠的齿轮计算器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步进计算器</td>\n<td>1673</td>\n<td>G. W. Leibniz</td>\n<td>加减乘除</td>\n<td>Leibniz 阶梯滚轮</td>\n<td>乘法机械化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差分机</td>\n<td>1822 起</td>\n<td>Charles Babbage</td>\n<td>多项式差分</td>\n<td>机械进位链</td>\n<td>迈向可编程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析机设计</td>\n<td>1837 起</td>\n<td>Charles Babbage</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>与穿孔卡片结合</td>\n<td>存储程序思想雏形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Babbage 的差分机（1822 年起）与由 Ada Lovelace 撰写算法笔记的分析机设计（1837 年起），把&quot;多个机械寄存器 + 可编程操作序列&quot;组合起来，让计算从单一函数升级为可编程装置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二进制与布尔代数-为机器选择数字系统\">二进制与布尔代数：为机器选择数字系统</h2><p>机械计算器用十进制，因为要给人看。但当计算设备从齿轮改为<strong>开关器件</strong>（继电器、真空管、晶体管）时，基数 10 的代价就暴露了：一个器件天然只有&quot;通/断&quot;两个稳定状态，硬要做十进制的每一位，要么用十个物理档位（如继电器组合），要么对每个十进制位单独编码，噪声容限与成本都急剧恶化。</p>\n<p>Leibniz 早已指出二进制在<strong>理论上的简洁</strong>：1703 年他在《论只使用符号 0 和 1 的二进制算术》中系统阐述了以 2 为基的表示，并注意到它与《易经》卦象的结构对应。二进制下，每个数字位只需区分两个状态，正好映射到一个开关：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\sum_{i=0}^{n} b_i \\cdot 2^i, \\quad b_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0691em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但&quot;用二进制表示数&quot;还不足以&quot;用二进制计算&quot;。这一步靠 George Boole 完成：1854 年的《思维规律的研究》把逻辑命题代数化，用 0/1 表示真/假，用 AND、OR、NOT 构成封闭的运算体系（布尔代数，见 <a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/\">Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: The Algebra of Logic</a>）。1937 年，Claude Shannon 在 MIT 硕士论文《继电器与开关电路的符号分析》中证明<strong>布尔代数与继电器开关电路同构</strong>——这一篇论文把&quot;逻辑&quot;和&quot;电路&quot;合流，成为数字电路设计的理论起点。</p>\n<p>它带来的直接结果是：算术可以被等价为逻辑。二进制加法器的一位输出就是布尔函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = A \\oplus B, \\quad C_{out} = A \\wedge B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加法被拆成异或与与门，乘法被拆成移位加求和。<strong>&quot;计算机&quot;因此不再需要&quot;会算数的零件&quot;，而只需要&quot;会判断真假的零件&quot;</strong>——这是从机械计算到电子计算的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字在机器里如何表示-补码-定点与浮点\">数字在机器里如何表示：补码、定点与浮点</h2><p>机械进位机构只能处理非负整数，而机器必须表示负数、小数和极大极小的量。有限位宽下，这需要三套独立的编码决策。</p>\n<p><strong>补码（two&#39;s complement）。</strong> 现代整型用固定位宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的补码，负数的值是&quot;对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取模&quot;的结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≡</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-x \\equiv 2^n - x \\pmod{2^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7977em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这带来的两个后果至今仍是工程日常。其一，加法和减法共用同一个加法器——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a - b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 直接算成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a + (2^n - b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并丢弃溢出位，与 Pascal 用补码技巧在加法机上实现减法如出一辙。其二，位宽有限意味着<strong>溢出必然回绕</strong>：<code>int32</code> 的最大值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2147483647</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}-1 = 2147483647</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2147483647</span></span></span></span></span>，加一得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2147483648</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2147483648</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2147483648</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是缺陷而是设计取舍——它让硬件加法器保持最快，代价是应用层必须自行处理溢出。</p>\n<p><strong>定点与浮点。</strong> 表示小数有两种思路。定点（fixed-point）约定小数点位置固定，用整数运算模拟小数，速度快、确定性强，至今用于金融与嵌入式领域。浮点（floating-point）则模仿科学记数法，用三个字段表示一个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = (-1)^s \\times m \\times 2^{e}, \\quad m \\in [1, 2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是符号位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是尾数（mantissa），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是偏置指数（exponent）。<code>IEEE 754</code> 于 1985 年统一了这些字段的位布局，此后成为几乎所有硬件的实现标准（<code>binary32</code> / <code>binary64</code> 即日常所说的单精度、双精度）。浮点用有限尾数近似实数，因此每个运算都要<strong>舍入</strong>；十进制小数如 0.1 在二进制下是无限循环小数，存入 <code>binary64</code> 时必然被截断，这解释了浮点相等判断为何必须用容差而非 <code>==</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>位宽示例</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>精度特性</th>\n<th>典型误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无符号整数</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>负数被当成巨大正数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补码整数</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2^{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>精确，溢出回绕</td>\n<td>金额累加静默溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定点数</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>由标度决定</td>\n<td>精确到标度</td>\n<td>标度不一致导致错位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制浮点</td>\n<td>64 位</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>308</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1.8 \\times 10^{308}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">308</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>53</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-53}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用 <code>==</code> 比较浮点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>十进制浮点</td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>由标准定义</td>\n<td>精确表示十进制小数</td>\n<td>未用十进制的金额计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对跨境电商工程而言，这套历史结论直接落地：<strong>金额、税率、运费分摊绝不能用二进制浮点累加</strong>，而应使用整数最小货币单位（如&quot;分&quot;）或十进制浮点（<code>IEEE 754-2008</code> 引入的 <code>decimal32/64/128</code>，对标 <a href=\"https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/754/6210/\">IEEE 754-2019</a>），否则多币种结算与对账会出现分位漂移。补码溢出、浮点舍入、定点标度——今天每一处数字表示的取舍，都能追溯到 Pascal 的进位环与 Leibniz 的二进制主张。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>位值制是机械计算的前提</strong>：把表达上限从&quot;符号数量&quot;转为&quot;位置数量&quot;，并把加法降维成可自动化的逐位进位操作。</li>\n<li><strong>机械计算器围绕&quot;进位&quot;设计</strong>：Pascal 的 sautoir 解决只进一位，Leibniz 的阶梯滚轮把乘法机械化，Babbage 把多个寄存器组合成可编程装置。</li>\n<li><strong>二进制 + 布尔代数把算术化为逻辑</strong>：Leibniz 主张二进制，Boole 建立逻辑代数，Shannon 证明电路与布尔代数同构——此后机器只需&quot;判断真假&quot;的零件。</li>\n<li><strong>有限位宽强制编码决策</strong>：补码统一加减法并导致溢出回绕；定点保精度、浮点保范围；<code>IEEE 754</code> 自 1985 年起统一浮点格式，2019 年修订版仍是当代实现依据。</li>\n<li><strong>历史即工程约束</strong>：<code>0.1 + 0.2</code> 的误差、<code>int32</code> 回绕、金额必须用整数分或十进制浮点，都是这段历史在当代码里的直接回声。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字表示与早期计算工具","id":"数字表示与早期计算工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从结绳到算盘：位值制的技术前提","id":"从结绳到算盘-位值制的技术前提"},{"level":2,"text":"机械计算器时代：从 Napier 到 Leibniz","id":"机械计算器时代-从-napier-到-leibniz"},{"level":2,"text":"二进制与布尔代数：为机器选择数字系统","id":"二进制与布尔代数-为机器选择数字系统"},{"level":2,"text":"数字在机器里如何表示：补码、定点与浮点","id":"数字在机器里如何表示-补码-定点与浮点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"数理逻辑与可计算性理论的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/history-of-ai-and-computing/foundations-of-computing-theory/logic-and-computability-foundations"}}